    given-names: "Yukang"
title: "Power Agent Biostatistics Benchmark"
version: 2.0.2
date-released: 2026-10-01
url: "https://github.com/ykzeng-yale/power-agent-benchmark"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ykzeng-yale/power-agent-benchmark"
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - biostatistics
  - power analysis
  - sample size
  - clinical trials
  - benchmark
  - LLM evaluation
  - machine learning
abstract: >
  Audited exploratory benchmark for fully specified biostatistical power
  and sample-size calculation tasks. The deterministic core includes
  20 sourced or explicitly constructed tasks with independent R and SciPy
  reference computations, judge-free structured scoring, frozen paired
  repeated runs, source-family provenance and all-attempt failure accounting.
  Legacy 106-task performance claims are withdrawn pending scientific audit.
